lly too much  about quotas and numbers which were  thinking about ability and that's what  we'll do and you're going to see a very  considerable cross-section of this  country standing for the requisite party  okay now you're going to try and  convince that the electorate that you  are different from UK it's similar in  policy but different in personnel yes  similar on Europe yes okay  but crucially personnel because of the  problem different personnel but but I  just thought we're going in the points  that regarding your former brexit party  leader she's already had to resign or  comments that she made on Twitter very  Islamophobic comments I mean this isn't  the best of starts is it we had a couple  of teething problems and let me tell you  something we are seeing arm two being  submissive we are going to be we're  going to be as a party deeply intolerant  of intolerance you know we're not the  Labour Party we're not going to turn a  blind eye to anti-semitism or any any of  those things we in the brexit party will  not have it all right so how confident  are you that the views of Miss Blakelock  are not widely held within the brexit  party we will not be having it all right  it's as simple as that  those views aren't widely held this is  just the beginning well you wait and see  you wait and see the list of 70 people  that we put before the British public  I've got a feeling there'll be the most  impressive list of candidates you've  ever seen from any UK political party  talking about a list of candidates so  impressive in candidates we were  surprised to see uh Nancy artery smoke  on the podium with you were you well  look this issue this issue is leaving  people in all of our parties feeling  absolutely let down cheated and betrayed  by what's going on so so what does she  bring to your party  well she's highly intelligent she  probably knows more about the European  subject and virtually anybody else maybe  apart from her brother and Bill cash  she knows the 