uid  and it's a very very heartening thing to  see you're putting a huge amount of  effort into the elections there is a  possibility that these in the elections  never come for Britain how confident are  you that we will get to May the 23rd  you can't start an election and call it  off midway through I mean people have  been cheated of one vote already to  cheat them of another one would be an  outrage but but there is a chance isn't  there but the withdrawal deal will make  it through Parliament before this  election date are you what do you think  about that could that happen I just  don't think I just do not believe that  Parliament is going to vote for this  appalling new treaty I just don't  believe it now and are you preparing for  a second referendum are you ready to  fight that  well we shouldn't have a second  referendum until until we've implemented  the first one so if there is a second  referendum in a few years time then yeah  we'll be ready for it there's no need to  have one now all we need to do is to  deliver people were promised explicitly  that if they voted for brexit in the  referendum that it would be implemented  and that's not happening and that is an  absolute failure of leadership and a  breakdown of trust and democracy in our  country and the general election are you  ready for that we're preparing for it  we're not ready for it we're only a  couple of weeks old you know we've done  an awful lot in a short space of time  but look 23rd of May for us is the  beginning of our political journey and  just very briefly mr. frost is it time  for treason later stand down well it was  time for her to stand down a long time  ago but I guess she'll stay on and and I  have to say I think she's the worst  leader I've seen in my lifetime I was at  the summit the other evening it was  pretty humiliating even being a British  person in attendance well leave it there  Nigel Faraj thank you very you

